{"login": "AlexanderNeo427", "location": "Singapore", "commits": [{"sha": "d7e6191884f48d63a84b7755b3548a65084094eb", "message": "Create README.md", "created_at": "2024-02-24T04:46:10Z", "repo": "BloxFace-The-Prequel", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "574171fc745b999df9346ee4f534d099dbd4ee0d", "message": "Merge branch 'Alex-Branch' of https://github.com/Richard-JRH/BloxFace-The-Prequel into Alex-Branch", "created_at": "2021-02-28T06:54:51Z", "repo": "BloxFace-The-Prequel", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7c2a7165543e7579915ddb09936de1686d0c5443", "message": "Double spawning of collectables should be fixed now\n\nTurns out that even though the zombies should have been destroyed, they were still taking damage, so now the TakeDamage function is more robust, and ensures they don't take damage again by setting their health to -Epsilon if they die\n\nAlso.......the CollectableManager accidently subscribed twice to the OnDeath event of the RegularZombie, so that's my bad.....", "created_at": "2021-02-28T06:53:33Z", "repo": "BloxFace-The-Prequel", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ccb23f7868c79be4f7da778df51918bc7ec118cc", "message": "Zombie hitboxes, TakeDamage()\n\n- Improved (hopefully) all the zombies' TakeDamage()\n   function, should be a little more robust\n- Zombie hitboxes are now larger/more forgiving\n  because the playtesters suck at aiming", "created_at": "2021-02-28T03:59:31Z", "repo": "BloxFace-The-Prequel", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "00c252a6dc0ad9cadd0848b3fe5751e590b6c433", "message": "Removed patrol states for zombies, lowered pathfinding quality, general tweaking of teammate", "created_at": "2021-02-25T16:52:01Z", "repo": "BloxFace-The-Prequel", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "41ed985ce109b6fc169f8b8e365402239bb3a13a", "message": "Player, teammate, zombies, unit cube wall, particle system (Read desc)\n\n- Player\n\t- PlayerEventHandler\n\t\t- Handle OnAttackPlayer from RunnerZombie\n- Teammate\n\t- Added customisable detection range\n\t- Added \"Chase enemy\" state\n\t- Using raycasts so they can know if\n\t  their LOS is being blocked by a wall\n\t- Upgrade weapons every few(3) waves\n\t- General tweaks\n- Zombies\n\t- Fixed (extremely painful) null errors\n\t- RunnerZombie\n\t\t- Added \"patrol\" state\n\t\t- Tagged as \"Enemy\"\n\t- Boss zombies\n\t\t- Use raycasts, so they can know if\n\t\t  their LOS is being blocked by a wall\n\t- General tweaks\n- Unit cube wall prefab\n\t- Set \"static\" property to true\n\t- Enabled \"GPU instancing\" for Mat_wall_translucent\n- Volumetric fog system (using particle system)", "created_at": "2021-02-23T18:38:10Z", "repo": "BloxFace-The-Prequel", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "07699e21546a88e9c3d3d7b528a7e57c955e3446", "message": "Small commit, read desc\n\n- Zombies\n\t- Added in patrol state\n\t- Added in customisable detection range\n\t- OnDamaged event (position, dmg amount)\n- Player\n       - OnPlayerDamaged event ( damageAmount )\n- Entities\n       - Increased pathfinding to good quality\n       - General tweaks etc....", "created_at": "2021-02-23T02:04:21Z", "repo": "BloxFace-The-Prequel", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "814f2325180c7c3fafffdafac6f56eeb4424ffaa", "message": "Teammate shooting half complete, bullets don't seem to be spawning properly", "created_at": "2021-02-21T18:51:45Z", "repo": "BloxFace-The-Prequel", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b8068b2d805b9a008734ed53a5d47cba5771be49", "message": "Camera shake, weapon controller for teammate half done...etc\n\n- Camera shake\n\t- Adjustable duration and magnitude\n\n- Camera now child of CameraHandler gameObject\n\t- Only way I could find to make camera shake work\n\n- Scriptable object base for guns\n   - pistol, shotgun, sniper, machine gun\n\n- Weapon controller for teammate, not done yet\n- IShootable interface for guns/weapons", "created_at": "2021-02-21T07:34:03Z", "repo": "BloxFace-The-Prequel", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "768e92f17cfe5e7b9a0f76676b787a54d802101e", "message": "Waypoint system for AI patrolling, patrol state for teammate", "created_at": "2021-02-20T11:06:48Z", "repo": "BloxFace-The-Prequel", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "248b38a53dbd2c33fa7902a202238b019db0b41d", "message": "Changes", "created_at": "2021-02-20T05:35:42Z", "repo": "BloxFace-The-Prequel", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "be4df1a20e39a830439697c76b0df72a1fe16f17", "message": "Fixed the bullet rotation thingy", "created_at": "2021-02-17T15:24:54Z", "repo": "BloxFace-The-Prequel", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "215ca807e6e4716f9e5c248e22b03a23d0926843", "message": "Mandelbrot Set", "created_at": "2021-11-06T06:42:18Z", "repo": "Fractal-Geometry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0ec231c12bdff16f57b331fa70eba21e5b281277", "message": "Some cleanup", "created_at": "2021-11-05T11:09:31Z", "repo": "Fractal-Geometry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "034b1f733f4f2be5f2ead3e7153747a8d9ac5818", "message": "Sierpinski Triangle + glm library", "created_at": "2021-08-20T14:30:53Z", "repo": "Fractal-Geometry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "801c73358c88838a20a88b9fe38eb4c7df5b21a1", "message": "Stufff", "created_at": "2021-08-20T12:02:38Z", "repo": "Fractal-Geometry", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e3a084f13fb5319b4245abc582420b986bb638c9", "message"